rgctl-kantra — embedded Konveyor rules catalog
==============================================

The default embedded rules catalog is compiled from the Konveyor rulesets
repository at build time.

  Upstream:  https://github.com/konveyor/rulesets
  Path:      stable/java
  Pin:       v0.9.2 (022bbd34b34eca53d04b6cb2b97b27e47fef479b)
  License:   Apache-2.0

Copyright holders and license terms for individual rules remain with the
Konveyor project and its contributors. This crate redistributes compiled
rule metadata only (identifiers, labels, categories, and `when` clauses) as
part of the rgctl binary.

When the git submodule under `assets/rulesets/` is not present, the build
uses the in-repo fixture at `tests/fixtures/kantra-rules/` (MIT OR Apache-2.0
per workspace license).

To update the vendored rulesets pin:

1. `cd crates/rgctl-kantra/assets/rulesets && git fetch --tags`
2. Check out the desired release tag.
3. Rebuild: `cargo build -p rgctl-kantra`
4. Commit the submodule pointer and update this NOTICE.
